.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
\fB0\fR
The command completed successfully.
.TP
\fB1\fR
The command failed. Possible causes include invalid configuration or a missing
interactive terminal.
.TP
\fB2\fR
The command-line arguments were invalid.
